...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

user: 사용자 { class: person }
ui: Streamlit UI (agent_runner.py) { class: ours }
api: OpenAI API { class: ext }

user -> ui: 메시지 + 실행 방법 선택
ui -> api: run() · run_sync() · run_streamed() 중 하나로 호출
api -> ui: (스트리밍이면) AgentUpdatedStreamEvent 먼저 도착
api -> ui: OPENAI_API_KEY 없음 -> openai.OpenAIError
ui -> user: except Exception -> st.error()로 표시
